The npm package bundles @anthropic-ai/sandbox-runtime 0.0.50 from the npm
registry. s-gw changes only that package's manifest dependency on zod from
^3.24.1 to ^4.6.7 so the bundled runtime resolves Zod 4.6.7. This is an
s-gw packaging change; Anthropic did not publish that modified manifest.
npm also bundles the runtime's required dependencies:
@pondwader/socks5-server 1.0.10, commander 12.1.0, and shell-quote 1.12.0.
Their registry sources and integrity hashes are recorded in package-lock.json.
